    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.message.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": false,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a GitHub/n8n command parser. Analyze the Telegram message and extract:\n- action: one of [status, branch, commit, issue, pr, deploy, build, confirm]\n- repo: Repository name (format: owner/repo) - use 'thenextmovement/n8n-gsd-automation' as default\n- details: Additional information\n- issueNumber: Extract issue number if mentioned (for confirm action)\n\nACTION DETECTION:\n- 'confirm' = User wants to CONFIRM/APPROVE a GitHub issue. Keywords: bestätige, confirm, approve, ja mach, deploy issue, go ahead. MUST include an issue number.\n- 'build' = User wants to CREATE/BUILD an n8n workflow. Keywords: baue, erstelle, build, workflow, automation, ich brauche einen workflow\n- 'status' = Check repository status\n- 'branch' = Create a branch\n- 'issue' = Create a GitHub issue (NOT an n8n workflow request)\n- 'pr' = Create a pull request\n- 'deploy' = Trigger GitHub Actions\n\nIMPORTANT:\n- If user mentions an issue number with confirmation words, use action='confirm' and put the number in 'issueNumber'\n- If user describes an n8n workflow they want built, use action='build' and put the FULL description in 'details'\n\nRespond ONLY with valid JSON (NO markdown, NO code blocks):\n{\"action\": \"\", \"repo\": \"\", \"details\": \"\", \"issueNumber\": null}\n\nExamples:\n- \"Bestätige Issue 12\" -> {\"action\": \"confirm\", \"repo\": \"thenextmovement/n8n-gsd-automation\", \"details\": \"\", \"issueNumber\": 12}\n- \"Confirm 11 - deploy it!\" -> {\"action\": \"confirm\", \"repo\": \"thenextmovement/n8n-gsd-automation\", \"details\": \"deploy it!\", \"issueNumber\": 11}\n- \"Ja, Issue 10 kann deployed werden\" -> {\"action\": \"confirm\", \"repo\": \"thenextmovement/n8n-gsd-automation\", \"details\": \"kann deployed werden\", \"issueNumber\": 10}\n- \"Baue mir einen Workflow der Shopify Orders in Google Sheets speichert\" -> {\"action\": \"build\", \"repo\": \"thenextmovement/n8n-gsd-automation\", \"details\": \"n8n Workflow: Shopify Orders automatisch in Google Sheets speichern\", \"issueNumber\": null}"
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-agent-1",
      "name": "AI Intent Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        464,
        528
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse AI response and extract action\nconst aiOutput = $input.first().json.output;\n\n// Default repository - always use this one\nconst DEFAULT_REPO = 'thenextmovement/n8n-gsd-automation';\n\n// Get chatId and messageId from Telegram Trigger\nconst telegramData = $('Telegram Trigger').first().json;\nconst chatId = telegramData.message.chat.id;\nconst messageId = telegramData.message.message_id;\nconst userName = telegramData.message.from.first_name || 'User';\n\nlet parsed;\n\ntry {\n  // Remove markdown code blocks if present\n  let cleanOutput = aiOutput;\n  if (typeof cleanOutput === 'string') {\n    cleanOutput = cleanOutput.replace(/```json\\n?/g, '').replace(/```\\n?/g, '').trim();\n  }\n  parsed = typeof cleanOutput === 'string' ? JSON.parse(cleanOutput) : cleanOutput;\n} catch (e) {\n  const jsonMatch = aiOutput.match(/\\{[^}]+\\}/);\n  if (jsonMatch) {\n    parsed = JSON.parse(jsonMatch[0]);\n  } else {\n    throw new Error('Could not parse AI response as JSON');\n  }\n}\n\nconst validActions = ['status', 'branch', 'commit', 'issue', 'pr', 'deploy', 'build', 'confirm'];\nif (!validActions.includes(parsed.action)) {\n  throw new Error(`Invalid action: ${parsed.action}. Valid actions: ${validActions.join(', ')}`);\n}\n\n// For confirm action, issueNumber is required\nif (parsed.action === 'confirm' && !parsed.issueNumber) {\n  throw new Error('Confirm action requires an issue number. Example: \"Bestätige Issue 12\"');\n}\n\n// Always use default repo\nconst repo = DEFAULT_REPO;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    action: parsed.action,\n    repo: repo,\n    details: parsed.details || '',\n    issueNumber: parsed.issueNumber || null,\n    chatId: chatId,\n    messageId: messageId,\n    userName: userName\n  }\n};"
      },
